'''Kōichi Sakaguchi''' (Japanese: '''坂口候一''' ''Sakaguchi Kōichi'') is a Japanese voice actor for {{aniseries|PTS}}.

==Biography==
Sakaguchi was born on February 10, 1968 in {{wp|Tokyo}}, {{wp|Japan}}, and became a voice actor as an adult. He joined {{aniseries|PTS}} early on, playing various roles, usually as Pokémon. His most prominent roles are those of {{TP|Jessie|Jessie's Ekans and Arbok|Arbok}}, as well as [[Raoul Contesta]].

